1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,567
Day three. Rain again. Sam finds the
perfect tree. Big glossy leaves.
Little green apples.

2
00:00:06,067 --> 00:00:08,000
Free fruit! Finally, the buffet.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,267
Rain drips off the leaves onto his
arm. And his arm starts to burn.

4
00:00:12,767 --> 00:00:16,200
Rule seven. If you can't name the
tree, don't stand under it.

5
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:22,933
The manchineel. The beach apple. Its
sap blisters skin, even when it's only
rain running off the leaves.

6
00:00:23,433 --> 00:00:28,167
And its smoke can blind you. With my
lungs, one campfire of it would finish
me.

7
00:00:28,667 --> 00:00:29,900
I'd like to leave a review.
